# Local state (see versions.tf for when this moves to S3) and operator-specific
# variable values — the state file can contain secrets and must never be
# committed. `.terraform.lock.hcl` is deliberately NOT here: it is this
# directory's Cargo.lock, and committing it keeps provider versions reproducible
# across machines.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars

# Rendered from the `.tmpl` beside each by `mise run deploy:api`, out of values that
# only the OpenTofu state knows — the SNS topic ARN, the backup bucket, the
# region. Committing them would mean a second copy of each value with nothing
# reconciling it against the resource that defines it.
box/alertmanager.yml
box/cron.d/ond
box/loki.yaml
